---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/Footer.astro';
---
<Default />
<p class="site-notice">
  Documentation for <a href="https://github.com/ewhauser/outis">ewhauser/outis</a>, research software for de-identifying clinical text.
  <small>Outis has been evaluated only on synthetic and public benchmark text. It does not by itself provide HIPAA Safe Harbor or Expert Determination de-identification. Never put real PHI in an issue, pull request or test fixture.</small>
</p>
<style>
  .site-notice { margin-top: 1.5rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline); font-size: var(--sl-text-xs); color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
  .site-notice small { display: block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: inherit; }
</style>
